# Usefulness: This feature measures how complex the code is relative to its size (line count). Modules with higher cyclomatic complexity density are likely harder to test/maintain and thus more defect-prone. This aligns with the relationship between complexity and software quality described in the dataset.

df['cyclomatic_complexity_density'] = df['v(g)'] / (df['loc'] + 1)
