# Feature: v_per_loc
# Feature description: Ratio of Halstead volume (v) to lines of code (loc) to capture coding complexity per line of code.
# Usefulness: This feature helps measure how densely complex the code is relative to its size. Modules with high complexity but low code volume could indicate a greater likelihood of defects.
